odot/pull/111628#issuecomment-4008675802","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111628","id":4008675802,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7u74na","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T00:27:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T00:27:26Z","body":">  I do agree this should be default like many applications do, also with alt+left / alt+right, .\r\n\r\nI've tried to implement this in an earlier revision of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117130, but Tree will \"eat\" the Alt + arrow inputs to collapse/expand tree sections. We need to fix that first, probably by making Tree not collapse/expand sections if holding <kbd>Alt</kbd>.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008675802/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4008814034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111628#issuecomm