028824","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111628","id":4102028824,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70f_4Y","user":{"login":"Cautami","id":219921783,"node_id":"U_kgDODRu9dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219921783?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami","html_url":"https://github.com/Cautami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cautami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T03:24:38Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T03:25:53Z","body":"Had a small amount of git trouble, may have slightly messed up merging both commits into one (rebase my behated). Should be fixed now though.\r\n\r\nNothing changed aside from merging both individual commits I've made, nor do I actually think much needs to be changed per se, very simple code.\r\n\r\nIn regards to the bugs mentioned by KoBeWi, those are issues with the FileSystem's history system in general, and I agree with them being very annoying, I would love if the filter was included as part of the history somehow, but I'm not entirely sure this PR is the one to deal with them, as all this is doing is basically making M5/M4 function the same as pressing the buttons manually, which is the intent. \r\nI could look into the history in a separate PR, but the history being fixed in general would also fix the issues you've noticed in this PR. \r\n\r\n(Excuse my lateness as well, prioritized finishing up a small project I had)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4102028824/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]